  "scope": "Independent original Rust crown-height and linked/independent side hair-contour fields, manually reviewed source-owned contours/probes/protection and actual retained six-class hair evidence. Real current-photo original/opaque-SDR derived full mixed image review, exact native ACK/terminal publication, canonical graph/support history and full-source export. Existing RGB/body sampler and legacy recipes retained. Actual hair-family app-lifetime extraction, not a renamed head-size or colour control.",
