  "remaining": [
    "All numerical, ABI, UI, photo-quality, memory/performance, interruption, history/reopen/export acceptance UNRUN. No 24MP, speed or runtime pixel-parity guarantee.",
    "Contours, anatomy, other-person exclusion and background-transition ownership require explicit human review. Existing semantic hair model is neither instance, crown, ear, occlusion nor background-proof segmentation.",
    "No hair synthesis/density increase, automatic anatomy, vendor algorithm parity, or inferred distinction between the two official crown labels. Original signed local ranges are documented.",
    "Crowded/occluded/contact hair, clipped contours and sampled cross-owner geometry conflicts may be refused without silent strength attenuation. No continuous multi-field injectivity or photo-naturalness claim.",
    "Preset/batch/persistent-cohort/shared-source-alias transfer remains refused. Source support, probes, masks and protected regions are never copied from another image.",
    "Existing original RGB8/16 and opaque SDR derived contracts only. Display RGB8 review does not change master precision or add alpha/HDR support. No native-resolution source contour inspection.",
    "Authoritative project reopen retains old uncertain outcomes rather than claiming rollback or success. No blind retry.",
    "Independent neck-wrinkle design remains excluded for the next source slice; hand model/contour ownership remains researched and unavailable."
